java.question:
What does this nested-loop search return?

```java
int[] nums = {2, 3, 5, 9, 12};
int target = 5;
for (int i = 0; i < nums.length; i++) {
    for (int j = i + 1; j < nums.length; j++) {
        if (nums[i] + nums[j] == target) return true;
    }
}
return false;
```

