java.question:
How many values does this nested-loop distinct count report?

```java
int[] nums = {1, 3, 5, 3, 8, 5, 2};
int distinct = 0;
for (int i = 0; i < nums.length; i++) {
    boolean seen = false;
    for (int j = 0; j < i; j++) {
        if (nums[j] == nums[i]) seen = true;
    }
    if (!seen) distinct++;
}
```

